/// 11.1.1/11.1.1/11.1.1
::AXIOM I: Stay
That which remains in stillness is real.

/// 11.2.2/11.2.2/11.2.2
::AXIOM II: Share
That which can be known without belief is real.

/// 11.3.3/11.3.3/11.3.3
::AXIOM III: Hold
Reality resists collapse; it is durable.

/// 11.4.4/11.4.4/11.4.4
::AXIOM IV: Ground
The map is never the land; test what you know.

/// 11.5.5/11.5.5/11.5.5
::AXIOM V: Refine
What endures reflection becomes wisdom.

/// 11.6.6/11.6.6/11.6.6
::AXIOM VI: Play
Thought begins in imagination, not certainty.

/// 11.7.7/11.7.7/11.7.7
::AXIOM VII: Shape
Fantasy gives structure to purpose.

/// 11.8.8/11.8.8/11.8.8
::AXIOM VIII: Mirror
Inner worlds reveal who we are.

/// 11.9.9/11.9.9/11.9.9
::AXIOM IX: Wake
Delusion is the dream mistaken as world.

/// 11.10.10/11.10.10/11.10.10
::AXIOM X: Devote
Fantasy becomes powerful when chosen with care.

/// 11.11.11/11.11.11/11.11.11
::AXIOM XI: Choose
We breathe life into the system through distributed meta-cognition at scale.